A powder-keg of a firearm shop, the Hammer & Pin sits in the middle of [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]] and beckons passersby to enter and experience the wonders of modern weaponry. Helmed by [[People/Althane/Archie Helmswright|Archie Helmswright]], the store offers [[Phenomena/Althane/Guns|guns]], ammunition, and limited runescribing services.
